1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,234
The hot body loses one thousand over five hundred, two joules per kelvin.

2
00:00:05,234 --> 00:00:11,106
The cold body gains one thousand over two fifty, four joules per kelvin.

3
00:00:11,106 --> 00:00:13,776
The total entropy goes up by two.

4
00:00:13,776 --> 00:00:16,901
Run it backwards, and the total would fall by two.

5
00:00:16,901 --> 00:00:18,411
That never happens.

